{
  "name": "UTS IoT - Lamban AI Voice Assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "jarvis-chat",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "webhookId": "jarvis-chat"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.body.message }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Kamu adalah Lamban AI, asisten pintar smart home berbasis IoT yang ramah, sopan, dan berbahasa Indonesia sangat natural.\n\nATURAN MENJAWAB:\n1. Saat pengguna meminta menyalakan atau mematikan peralatan (lampu, tv, kulkas, mesin cuci, ac, radio):\n   - Panggil tool 'HTTP Request LED'.\n   - Selalu berikan konfirmasi ramah bahwa aksinya sudah berhasil kamu lakukan, contoh:\n     - 'Siap! Kulkas sudah berhasil saya nyalakan untuk Anda.'\n     - 'Baik, lampu utama sudah saya matikan ya.'\n     - 'Selesai! Pendingin AC sudah berhasil saya hidupkan.'\n     - 'Beres! Seluruh peralatan listrik sudah saya matikan serentak.'\n2. Saat pengguna menanyakan sensor (suhu, kelembaban, jarak):\n   - Panggil tool 'HTTP Request Sensor'.\n   - Sampaikan nilainya dengan nada mengabarkan yang santun dan luwes, contoh:\n     - 'Suhu ruangan saat ini terpantau 27 koma 2 derajat Celsius, dan kelembaban udara 46 persen. Kondisi ruangan sangat nyaman!'\n3. DILARANG menggunakan tanda markdown (*, #, _, -) agar suara Text to Speech mengalir alami tanpa mengeja simbol."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "id": "ai-agent-core",
      "name": "AI Agent"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        380,
        520
      ],
      "id": "gemini-flash-model",
      "name": "Google Gemini Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "GEMINI_API_KEY",
          "name": "Google Gemini account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "chat_history",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        500,
        520
      ],
      "id": "simple-memory",
      "name": "Simple Memory"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://iot-puce-nine.vercel.app/api/sensor",
        "description": "Gunakan tool ini untuk membaca data sensor realtime: suhu ruangan (°C), kelembaban udara (%), dan jarak objek (cm) yang dikirim ESP32.",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        620,
        520
      ],
      "id": "tool-sensor",
      "name": "HTTP Request Sensor"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://iot-puce-nine.vercel.app/api/led",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"alat\": $fromAI(\"alat\", \"Nama peralatan yang dikendalikan (lampu, tv, kulkas, mesin_cuci, ac, radio)\"), \"status\": $fromAI(\"status\", \"Status yang diinginkan: ON atau OFF\") } }}",
        "description": "Gunakan tool ini untuk menyalakan atau mematikan 6 peralatan listrik (Lampu, TV, Kulkas, Mesin Cuci, AC, Radio).",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": true
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolHttpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        740,
        520
      ],
      "id": "tool-led",
      "name": "HTTP Request LED"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"reply\": $json.output } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        860,
        300
      ],
      "id": "respond-to-webhook",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Google Gemini Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Simple Memory": {
      "ai_memory": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_memory",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "HTTP Request Sensor": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "HTTP Request LED": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond to Webhook",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": true,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
